            "content": "<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border-width: 1px; border-color: #000000;\" border=\"1\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 99.8632%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"fontstyle0\">Tardigrades</span></h4>\n<p>&bull;&nbsp;more than 1,000 species, 0.05- 1.2 millimetres long</p>\n<p>&bull; also known as water 'bears' (due to how they <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_31\">______</span>) and 'moss piglets'</p>\n<p><strong>Physical appearance</strong></p>\n<p>&bull;&nbsp;a <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_32\">______</span>&nbsp;round body and four pairs of legs</p>\n<p>&bull; claws or <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_33\">______</span> for gripping</p>\n<p>&bull; absence of respiratory organs</p>\n<p>&bull; body filled with a liquid that carries both <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_34\">______</span>&nbsp;and blood</p>\n<p>&bull; mouth shaped like a <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_35\">______</span>&nbsp;with teeth called stylets</p>\n<p><strong><span class=\"fontstyle0\">Habitat</span></strong></p>\n<p>&bull;&nbsp;often found at the bottom of a lake or on plants</p>\n<p>&bull; very resilient and can exist in very low or high <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_36\">______</span></p>\n<p><strong><span class=\"fontstyle0\">Cryptobiosis</span></strong></p>\n<p>&bull;&nbsp;In dry conditions, they roll into a ball called a 'tun'.</p>\n<p>&bull;&nbsp;They stay alive with a much lower metabolism than usual.</p>\n<p>&bull; A&nbsp;type of <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_37\">______</span>&nbsp;ensures their DNA is not damaged.</p>\n<p>&bull;&nbsp;Research is underway to find out how many days they can stay alive&nbsp;in <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_38\">______</span>.</p>\n<p><strong><span class=\"fontstyle0\">Fee</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">ding</span></strong></p>\n<p>&bull;&nbsp;consume liquids, e.g., those found in moss or <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_39\">______</span></p>\n<p>&bull;&nbsp;may eat other tardigrades</p>\n<p>Conservation status</p>\n<p>&bull;&nbsp;They are not considered to be <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_40\">______</span>.&nbsp;</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
